  "prefLabel": "He-P 2350.05 Fees",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-P 2350.05 Fees.\n\n(a) The fee for a cold storage license shall be $350.\n\n(b) All fees paid shall be:\n\n(1) Nontransferable; and\n\n(2) Nonrefundable.\n\n(c) Any instrument of payment returned to the state shall be processed in accordance with RSA 6:11-a.\n\nSource. #8659, eff 6-14-06; ss by #9589, eff 11-5-09, EXPIRED: 11-5-17",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-p2300.html"
